    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/91fe9fb340eddfaca07c91c80a78a295.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quaso Studio: The Liven Collection</strong> brings together two first-person psychological horror experiences, crafted in a retro PS1 style and driven by an oppressive, stylized atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into two different yet connected stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/2f6e18f2dfa0b245073201037f233cbc.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/3f9fa84540fc355e80411a2bb71f79f8.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/67479a47ad589fe9b0e55b9cfed0ffd5.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Kevin LIVEN</strong>, a 17-year-old home alone. As you go about your daily chores, the lights suddenly go out\u2026 <br>Someone breaks into the house. You're trapped. Hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast. Hide. Restore the power. <br>Your last hope lies in your father\u2019s locked toolbox \u2014 but the code remains a mystery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/58d8acc9c86845f553d33d817aa1f77c.poster.avif?t=1749844974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/58d8acc9c86845f553d33d817aa1f77c.webm?t=1749844974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/58d8acc9c86845f553d33d817aa1f77c.mp4?t=1749844974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the killer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, oppressive atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/c40a063ea24233efe7fab1c47be0a7eb.poster.avif?t=1749844974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/c40a063ea24233efe7fab1c47be0a7eb.webm?t=1749844974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/c40a063ea24233efe7fab1c47be0a7eb.mp4?t=1749844974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/c36a848b2a541bdf82dc0d589aba6664.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/dc918ea662667522926a4f00a4136343.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/9a7be26b80425294438af7ffa1fa13f3.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years after <i>The To-Do List</i>, <strong>Marla Myers</strong>, director of an art gallery, finds herself trapped in a crimson velvet purgatory, haunted by her past mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must explore the limbo of her own mind across two parallel worlds. Find the clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rouge Carmin</i> is a narrative psychological horror game with a bold painterly aesthetic. <br>No weapons. No escape. Only your memories, your guilt\u2026 and a way out to uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an intense, twist-filled narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and collect key clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting, painterly atmosphere <br> </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/91fe9fb340eddfaca07c91c80a78a295.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quaso Studio: The Liven Collection</strong> brings together two first-person psychological horror experiences, crafted in a retro PS1 style and driven by an oppressive, stylized atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into two different yet connected stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/2f6e18f2dfa0b245073201037f233cbc.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/3f9fa84540fc355e80411a2bb71f79f8.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/67479a47ad589fe9b0e55b9cfed0ffd5.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Kevin LIVEN</strong>, a 17-year-old home alone. As you go about your daily chores, the lights suddenly go out\u2026 <br>Someone breaks into the house. You're trapped. Hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast. Hide. Restore the power. <br>Your last hope lies in your father\u2019s locked toolbox \u2014 but the code remains a mystery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/58d8acc9c86845f553d33d817aa1f77c.poster.avif?t=1749844974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/58d8acc9c86845f553d33d817aa1f77c.webm?t=1749844974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/58d8acc9c86845f553d33d817aa1f77c.mp4?t=1749844974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the killer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, oppressive atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/c40a063ea24233efe7fab1c47be0a7eb.poster.avif?t=1749844974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/c40a063ea24233efe7fab1c47be0a7eb.webm?t=1749844974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/c40a063ea24233efe7fab1c47be0a7eb.mp4?t=1749844974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/c36a848b2a541bdf82dc0d589aba6664.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/dc918ea662667522926a4f00a4136343.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/9a7be26b80425294438af7ffa1fa13f3.avif?t=1749844974\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years after <i>The To-Do List</i>, <strong>Marla Myers</strong>, director of an art gallery, finds herself trapped in a crimson velvet purgatory, haunted by her past mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must explore the limbo of her own mind across two parallel worlds. Find the clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rouge Carmin</i> is a narrative psychological horror game with a bold painterly aesthetic. <br>No weapons. No escape. Only your memories, your guilt\u2026 and a way out to uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an intense, twist-filled narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and collect key clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting, painterly atmosphere <br> </p></li></ul>",
